<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 97,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 97,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog receipts Monday were 97,000 head, compared with the estimate of 95,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50 per cwt lower, compared to midsession Monday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    56.50 -58.50	   57.50 -59.50</p>
<p>liberal volume	 57.00 -58.00	   58.00 -59.00</p>
<p>few			56.00  59.00	   57.00  60.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 46.00 -48.00	   47.00 -49.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   48.00 -50.00	   48.00 -50.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    50.00 -53.00	   50.00 -54.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
